{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51347","headline":"九鲤湖 · 许稷","name":"九鲤湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道是烧丹地，依然云水居。\n山空人去後，梦醒客去初。\n溪雨飞沙霁，岩门隐雾虚。\n高歌对明月，松影落扶疎。\n（《古今图书集成·山川典》三○二《九鲤湖部》。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许稷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}